      "en": "Therefore produce fruit worthy of repentance!",
      "ko": "그러므로 회개에 합당한 열매를 맺고",
      "source_text_hash": "212658a6d8c07c5047ea8fac5e1178124d87531f327b751a9ff82d1d59099ef3",
