      "en": "Even now the ax lies at the root of the trees. Therefore every tree that doesn’t produce good fruit is cut down, and cast into the fire.",
      "ko": "이미 도끼가 나무 뿌리에 놓였으니 좋은 열매 맺지 아니하는 나무마다 찍어 불에 던지우리라",
      "source_text_hash": "dd857866344653f8e760e44e233e4416fdb5dd3d46a369fca30b83b01d06b3ab",
      "translation_text_hash": "0ee5c8e06c8b1cc8224375db3ce7bddc61e28f8f4f9e94e9190875b48c7b499e",
