      "en": "His winnowing fork is in his hand, and he will thoroughly cleanse his threshing floor. He will gather his wheat into the barn, but the chaff he will burn up with unquenchable fire.”",
      "ko": "손에 키를 들고 자기의 타작 마당을 정하게 하사 알곡은 모아 곡간에 들이고 쭉정이는 꺼지지 않는 불에 태우시리라",
      "source_text_hash": "25e891945142b3b5406acee100728cb580f6d3f5ec2e9935b07bf4d4868976f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "f26066910051e7aebdbcc6bc72c753ea0a82b128e51c1ea56db7ed59b77ccbf4",
